    size: { weightKg: [486, 528], typicalKg: 498, withersCm: null, girthCm: null, cannonCm: null, build: 'tall', notes: 'ja.wikipedia: "生まれたころから脚長の好馬体だった". 498 kg in the 1997 February S. 486-504 kg in 1996-97, then 514-528 kg on his 1999 comeback (528 kg, +42, in the Yasuda Kinen after about 2 years off).' },
