    size: { weightKg: [496, 538], typicalKg: 514, withersCm: null, girthCm: null, cannonCm: null, build: 'rangy', notes: 'Race-day 馬体重 from netkeiba (all 23 starts): 504 at debut, 500 (-6) when he won the Aoba Sho 2011, 496 in the 2011 Derby (his lightest), 516 in the Kikuka Sho, 522 in the Kyoto Kinen 2012, 538 (+30) on his return in the 2013 Kinko Sho after 17 months off (his heaviest), 534 in Arima 2013, 526 when he won the Nikkei Sho 2014. keibalab (中山義一): 「脚長の体型」「この馬は大型馬だけど薄手なので、距離をこなす」, so build is rangy: big and long-legged but slim. No measurements were found.' },
