    gear: { hood: true, hoodColors: { main: '#111111', trim: '#111111', ears: '#111111', pattern: 'x', accent: '#4aa8e8' }, blinkers: false, shadowRoll: false, bitLifter: false, bridle: '#1a1714', pompom: null, bandages: { fore: '#f2f0ea', hind: '#f2f0ea' }, notes: 'ja.wiki 逸話: after losing all of the 2012 fillies\' triple crown races to Gentildonna, 「サンデーレーシングの勝負服に対抗してバツ印をデザインしたメンコを着用していた」. From 2013 the hood is black with black ear covers and a light-blue/blue X across the face (2013 Osaka Hai paddock, JRA VM 2014 race photo, 2014 QEII Cup paddock); the trim colour stands in for that X, which is not drawn. In the 2012 Oka Sho paddock it was plain black. No blinkers or shadow roll. Black bridle. White leg bandages with light-blue and navy stripes at the top.' },
    silks: { owner: '佐々木主浩 (Kazuhiro Sasaki)', desc: '水色、青鋸歯形、白袖青二本輪', colors: ['#59bce7', '#1f3fc8', '#ffffff'] }, // a JRA-style reading of the Commons silks image and race photos, not an official text
